# TypeScript/JavaScript Hooks

> Extends [common/hooks.mdc](../common/hooks.mdc).

If project hooks are introduced later, use repository-owned commands:

- Biome for focused formatting and linting.
- The affected Nx project's typecheck target for type validation.
- A changed-file check for debug logging and accidental secret exposure.

Do not configure alternate package managers, formatters, linters, global
TypeScript checks, or automatic full builds for this project. Hooks must not be
created merely because this guidance describes acceptable behavior.
